321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 203 0 R
/T (Urban landscapes today face a growing challenge - maintaining lawns while saving time and energy. Homeowners often struggle with uneven grass growth and unpredictable yard conditions that reduce visual appeal and increase effort especially in gardens where the pathway distance is small and limited. AUTO-MOW was developed as a step toward solving this, offering a smarter approach to lawn maintenance and garden care.)
/E (Urban landscapes today face a growing challenge - maintaining lawns while saving time and energy. Homeowners often struggle with uneven grass growth and unpredictable yard conditions that reduce visual appeal and increase effort especially in gardens where the pathway distance is small and limited. AUTO-MOW was developed as a step toward solving this, offering a smarter approach to lawn maintenance and garden care.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 203 0 R
/T (The system uses vision-based detection to locate overgrown grass areas and identify zones that require trimming based on height and surface patterns. Alongside, moisture and terrain sensors check into the ground when required to understand softness and surface levels. Once the system detects tall grass, it automatically adjusts the cutting height and speed to be applied, reducing energy usage and unnecessary passes.)
/E (The system uses vision-based detection to locate overgrown grass areas and identify zones that require trimming based on height and surface patterns. Alongside, moisture and terrain sensors check into the ground when required to understand softness and surface levels. Once the system detects tall grass, it automatically adjusts the cutting height and speed to be applied, reducing energy usage and unnecessary passes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 203 0 R
/T (To make the solution garden-ready, AUTO-MOW features a compact-drive mechanism that lets the mower move smoothly even between narrow garden paths and flower rows without harming plants. Supported by algorithms and GPS-based navigation, the robot monitors section digitally, ensuring accurate cutting and a sustainable approach to modern lawn care.)
/E (To make the solution garden-ready, AUTO-MOW features a compact-drive mechanism that lets the mower move smoothly even between narrow garden paths and flower rows without harming plants. Supported by algorithms and GPS-based navigation, the robot monitors section digitally, ensuring accurate cutting and a sustainable approach to modern lawn care.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
