410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/E (Modern lawn maintenance demands more than just efficiency - it calls for precision, sustainability, and intelligent adaptability. Conventional mowing equipment struggles to navigate narrow garden paths, especially in parks and landscaped areas, often causing unintended plant damage. Simultaneously, the overuse of manual effort and irregular cutting continue to affect lawn quality and reduce visual appeal. AUTO-MOW was conceptualized to overcome these long-standing challenges through balanced integration of robotics, sensing, and artificial intelligence. It aims to deliver a garden-ready solution that not only automates mowing operations but also ensures accuracy, minimal effort, and environmental responsibility )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
