441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (The AUTO-MOW architecture follows a hierarchical control model. The Raspberry Pi functions as the master controller, handling high-level navigation planning, image processing, and cloud synchronization through AWS IoT Core. The Arduino Mega manages low-level actuation, blade speed regulation, and motor control tasks. Communication between both units is established via a UART interface, while LoRa R-02 modules enable long-range wireless data exchange across the lawn. Lawn data, image logs, and sensor readings are uploaded to the AWS Cloud for storage, analytics, and mobile accessibility through a React Native-based user interface.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (8)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 214 0 R
/T (yet lightweight structure with high corrosion resistance, suitable for humid and outdoor conditions. The design includes a central mounting rail that supports interchangeable sensor and cutting modules, enabling modular maintenance and scalability. A dual-wheel differential drive system allows precise turns even within confined spaces, while a caster-assisted rear wheel stabilizes motion across uneven lawn terrain. The overall weight distribution has been optimized to maintain a low center of gravity, improving balance during operation on sloped lawns. To ensure durability, the frame is coated with anti-rust epoxy paint, and all fasteners are stainless. )
/E (yet lightweight structure with high corrosion resistance, suitable for humid and outdoor conditions. The design includes a central mounting rail that supports interchangeable sensor and cutting modules, enabling modular maintenance and scalability. A dual-wheel differential drive system allows precise turns even within confined spaces, while a caster-assisted rear wheel stabilizes motion across uneven lawn terrain. The overall weight distribution has been optimized to maintain a low center of gravity, improving balance during operation on sloped lawns. To ensure durability, the frame is coated with anti-rust epoxy paint, and all fasteners are stainless. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
