/E (Each mowing operation generates a synchronized safety response containing sensor readings, obstacle alerts, and movement coordinates. These are locally buffered in SQLite and periodically monitored by the control system. The safety module performs obstacle detection, collision avoidance, and emergency response for operational protection. Users can review obstacle alerts, system status charts, and safety reports directly on the mobile dashboard, allowing long-term monitoring of lawn safety and system reliability.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
