/Title (The Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\) are a set of 17 global objectives established by the United Nations in 2015 to create a more sustainable and better future for all by 2030. Adopted by 195 countries, these goals provide a universal framework for addressing global challenges such as sustainability, innovation, and environmental protection. The AUTOMOV autonomous lawn mower project is aligned with these goals, particularly focusing on sustainable urban development, technological innovation, and eco-friendly solutions. By integrating automation and energy-efficient systems, the project contributes to building smarter and more sustainable environments.)
