1388 0 obj
<<
/Title (Urban landscapes today face a growing challenge - maintaining lawns while saving time and energy. Homeowners often struggle with uneven grass growth and unpredictable yard conditions that reduce visual appeal and increase effort especially in gardens where the pathway distance is small and limited. AUTO-MOW was developed as a step toward solving this, offering a smarter approach to lawn maintenance and garden care.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1382 0 R
/Next 1392 0 R
>>
endobj
1389 0 obj
<<
/Title (To make the solution garden-ready, AUTO-MOW features a compact-drive mechanism that lets the mower move smoothly even between narrow garden paths and flower rows without harming plants. Supported by algorithms and GPS-based navigation, the robot monitors section digitally, ensuring accurate cutting and a sustainable approach to modern lawn care.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1382 0 R
/Prev 1392 0 R
>>
endobj
