1391 0 obj
<<
/Title (smart lawn care, where real-world adoption and collaboration are important. Through the website, the project team can demonstrate the practical relevance of the AUTO-MOW system and showcase how modern technologies such as artificial intelligence, sensors, and automation can be integrated to solve lawn maintenance challenges. The platform also supports knowledge sharing and encourages discussions about future improvements and applications.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1394 0 R
/Next 1383 0 R
>>
endobj
1392 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system uses vision-based detection to locate overgrown grass areas and identify zones that require trimming based on height and surface patterns. Alongside, moisture and terrain sensors check into the ground when required to understand softness and surface levels. Once the system detects tall grass, it automatically adjusts the cutting height and speed to be applied, reducing energy usage and unnecessary passes.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1382 0 R
/Prev 1388 0 R
/Next 1389 0 R
>>
endobj
