<<
/Title (5.2  Website Development  The project website was designed and developed by the team to present the AUTO-MOW system in a visually structured and informative manner. The platform includes sections that explain the problem addressed by the project, the motivation behind the development of the system, and the technological approach used to build the intelligent lawn mowing solution. Special attention was given to the clarity of information and the presentation of visuals so that visitors can easily understand the working of the system. The design approach focused on simplicity, readability, and accessibility while ensuring that the technical aspects of the project are communicated effectively. The website can be accessed at:  http://127.0.0.1:5500/AUTOMOV.html#about)
