1467 0 obj
<<
/Title (yet lightweight structure with high corrosion resistance, suitable for humid and outdoor conditions. The design includes a central mounting rail that supports interchangeable sensor and cutting modules, enabling modular maintenance and scalability. A dual-wheel differential drive system allows precise turns even within confined spaces, while a caster-assisted rear wheel stabilizes motion across uneven lawn terrain. The overall weight distribution has been optimized to maintain a low center of gravity, improving balance during operation on sloped lawns. To ensure durability, the frame is coated with anti-rust epoxy paint, and all fasteners are stainless.)
